{
  "shots": [
    {"text": "Veyra was a city of lanterns that never went dark.", "bg": "city", "move": "zoom_out", "fx": ["crystal_particles"]},
    {"text": "Their light came from memories: the fading ones, given freely.", "bg": "city", "move": "pan_right"},
    {"text": "Beneath the city, an engine of crystal and runes turned them into light.", "bg": "reliquary"},
    {"text": "They called it the Reliquary.", "bg": "reliquary", "move": "zoom_in", "fx": ["crystal_particles", "flash"]},
    {"text": "It was built by a king who was also an engineer.", "bg": "cs_aurelian_build", "bgFallback": "reliquary", "bg2": "aurelian_king", "split": "vertical", "bg2View": {"focus": [0.5, 0.34]}, "whenArt": {"bg2": null, "split": "none"}},
    {"text": "His name was Aurelian.", "bg": "cs_aurelian_cheered", "bgFallback": null, "layers": [{"img": "aurelian_king", "x": 0.5, "y": 0.58, "scale": 0.6}], "move": "zoom_in", "whenArt": {"layers": []}, "sfx": "sfx_crowd_cheer"},
    {"text": "Then came the Long War. Twenty years of it.", "bg": "cs_aurelian_war", "bgFallback": "battlefield", "fx": ["embers"]},
    {"text": "To end it, he taught the engine to tear a soldier out of every mind that knew him.", "bg": "cs_aurelian_engine_war", "bgFallback": "battlefield", "tint": "0x8a8a96", "layers": [{"img": "aurelian_king_kneel", "x": 0.5, "y": 0.48, "scale": 0.42}], "fx": ["embers"], "whenArt": {"layers": [], "tint": null}},
    {"text": "The enemy broke. But the council saw what their king now held.", "bg": "council"},
    {"text": "Afraid of him, they took the engine and named him the butcher of the war he had won.", "bg": "cs_council_trial", "bgFallback": "council", "move": "zoom_in", "tint": "0xff8a80"},
    {"text": "His sentence was his own weapon: the Unwriting.", "bg": "council", "fx": ["crystal_particles"]},
    {"text": "Every memory of him was torn from every mind in Veyra.", "bg": "reliquary", "layers": [{"img": "aurelian_king", "x": 0.5, "y": 0.6, "scale": 0.56}], "fx": ["dissolve_layer", "crystal_particles"]},
    {"text": "His statues fell. His name was chiseled from the stone.", "bg": "cs_statue", "bgFallback": "statue", "sfx": "stone_crack"},
    {"text": "Even those who loved him forgot he had ever lived.", "bg": "cs_statue", "bgFallback": "statue", "move": "zoom_in"},
    {"text": "For years, he wandered the ruins beyond the wall.", "bg": "cs_exile_ruins", "bgFallback": "battlefield", "ambience": "wind", "tint": "0x6070b0", "layers": [{"img": "aurelian_exile_kneel", "x": 0.5, "y": 0.48, "scale": 0.42}], "whenArt": {"layers": []}},
    {"text": "Once, he came back in secret, to see his daughter.", "bg": "cs_castle_daughter", "bgFallback": "street_rain", "layers": [{"img": "aurelian_exile", "x": 0.3, "y": 0.54, "scale": 0.34}], "fx": ["rain"], "whenArt": {"layers": [], "fx": []}},
    {"text": "She looked straight at him, and saw a stranger.", "bg": "street_rain", "bg2": "exile_close", "split": "vertical", "fx": ["rain"], "bg2View": {"focus": [0.5,0.4]}},
    {"text": "That was the day his grief became hatred.", "bg": "exile_close", "move": "zoom_in", "fx": ["eyes_glow"], "sfx": "ember_hiss"},
    {"text": "He did not come back for his throne.", "bg": "reliquary", "tint": "0x505a78"},
    {"text": "He came back for the engine they had stolen.", "bg": "cs_reliquary_red", "bgFallback": "reliquary", "bg2": "aurelian_exile", "split": "vertical", "tint": "0x505a78", "bg2View": {"focus": [0.62, 0.3]}, "fx": ["red_tint"], "sfx": "sfx_red_surge", "whenArt": {"bg2": null, "split": "none", "tint": null, "redTint": 0.1}},
    {"text": "That night, he fed it the council. Then thousands more.", "bg": "cs_reliquary_red", "bgFallback": "reliquary", "fx": ["flash", "crystal_particles", "red_tint"], "move": "zoom_in", "whenArt": {"redTint": 0.1}},
    {"text": "Every light in Veyra went dark. They call it the Hush.", "bg": "cs_hush_1", "bgFallback": "city", "fx": ["shake", "red_surge", "lights_out"], "surgeAt": [0.5, 0.35], "sfx": "sfx_scream_crowd", "ambience": null, "durationMs": 6000},
    {"text": "", "bg": "cs_hush_2", "bgFallback": null, "fx": [], "sfx": null, "ambience": null, "durationMs": 2000},
    {"text": "When the light returned, the king and the engine were one.", "bg": "cs_city_red_tower", "bgFallback": "city", "fx": ["flash", "red_tint"], "redTint": 0.14, "whenArt": {"redTint": 0.1}},
    {"text": "A hundred years later, he still rules. His servants live for decades more.", "bg": "cs_city_red_tower", "bgFallback": "city", "tint": "0x6070b0", "fx": ["rain", "red_tint"], "redTint": 0.14, "whenArt": {"redTint": 0.1}},
    {"text": "Those who defy him are unwritten. No one can keep a memory of them: the Forgotten.", "bg": "cs_forgotten", "bgFallback": "street_rain", "layers": [{"img": "blank", "x": 0.62, "y": 0.58, "scale": 2, "flip": true}], "fx": ["rain"], "whenArt": {"layers": []}},
    {"text": "From what is taken, his memorists shape monsters: the Hollows.", "bg": "cs_hollows", "bgFallback": "street_rain", "layers": [{"img": "hollow", "x": 0.3, "y": 0.58, "scale": 2}, {"img": "hollow", "x": 0.7, "y": 0.52, "scale": 2}], "move": "zoom_in", "fx": ["rain"], "whenArt": {"layers": []}},
    {"text": "Steel passes through a Hollow like smoke.", "bg": null, "layers": [{"img": "hollow", "x": 0.5, "y": 0.5, "scale": 2}], "fx": ["flash"]},
    {"text": "Only a memory can wound a memory.", "bg": null, "fx": ["crystal_particles"]},
    {"text": "Ordinary people learned it too: a little light, a little warmth, held in the hand.", "bg": "cs_echo_learning", "bgFallback": null, "fx": ["crystal_particles"]},
    {"text": "So the people learned to burn their own. They call it Echo.", "bg": "cs_echo_called", "bgFallback": null, "layers": [{"img": "rhea_body", "x": 0.5, "y": 0.5, "scale": 2, "flip": true}], "fx": ["crystal_particles"], "whenArt": {"layers": []}},
    {"text": "And a few of them learned to fight back.", "bg": null, "durationMs": 3500}
  ]
}
